
check-bypass-flags: VIOLATION (COMMIT_EDITMSG)
  subject:  chore: from the hook

  Body mentions a test-bypass flag (matched: --skip-tests )
  Gate I requires a line of the form:
    Bypass tickets: TICKET-1, TICKET-2 (one ticket per broken test)

  And a justification per ticket. Without this, bypassing a test
  ships an unowned regression. Source: practices/regression-fix-protocol.md §Gate I

check-bypass-flags: 1 violation(s)
Wire as commit-msg hook:  printf '#!/bin/sh\nexec rebar run check-bypass-flags "$1"\n' > .git/hooks/commit-msg && chmod +x .git/hooks/commit-msg
--- exit 1 ---
